---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import StudioGlyph from './StudioGlyph.astro';
---
<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">Independent creative developer <span>/ Malaysia</span></p>
  <h1 id="hero-heading">PROBLEMS.<br/>MEET<br/><em>SOLUTIONS.</em></h1>
  <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><StudioGlyph/><span class="glyph-coordinate">IS / A different way through.</span></div>
  <div class="hero-bottom"><div class="hero-description"><p>I design and build distinctive websites that help businesses make their offer clear and give people a straightforward next step.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#work">Explore the work <Arrow diagonal/></a><a class="button button-outline" href="#contact">Start a project <Arrow diagonal/></a></div><p class="starting-note">Frontend websites, starting from RM599.</p></div><p class="hero-thesis">An idea.<br/>A point of view.<br/>A useful website.</p></div>
  <div class="hero-foot"><span>IDEA / DESIGN / BUILD</span><a href="#work">Scroll to explore ↓</a></div>
</section>
